Z||000000||hyhy4u||08-21-2001||11:17 PM||||Next System- Ign. System!..Ive just got done redoing my air system so next on the list is my Ignition System.  Heres what im replacing,<P>-New Coil- Thinking about MSD..good??, at first i was gonna use Accel but ive heard to much crap about how bad they where<P>-New Igition Box- Again thinking MSD..i cant say ive heard anything bad about them period, anything better or any adive??<P>-New Wires- To be honest with ya i dont have that much knowledge with wires..i would like something red, just to stand out a little more in my engine compartment..size??..Kind??<P>-Distributor Cap- ok..dont ask me which one..i dont have any knowledge of these things.haha..Give me some advice!<P>-Plugs- I got new ones but while we are at it lets just go with the whole works for anyone else out there.<P>My Ign. System looks like it hasent been changed since it rolled out the factory in 87..not looking to Increase any horsepower..just trying to restore some lost H.P while hopefully increasing my moderate gas milage. 20/City. Also just trying to spuce up the engine compartment a little and make it look a little more.."high Tech".  Thanks for Inputs!<P>-Jason-<P>||||reg||10
